Code-as-Memory (CaM)

The Python policy interface, restricted execution, streamed observation transport,
and development accounting are adapted from the earlier robot policy
implementation developed for RoboMME and RoboMME-Plus, distributed under the
Apache License 2.0. Modified source files identify this adaptation.

The official RoboMME benchmark is a pinned, unmodified Git submodule at
third_party/robomme_benchmark. Its own LICENSE and notices apply. Benchmark
assets and separately downloaded datasets retain their upstream terms.

Historical experiment references retain their original method labels, prompt
hashes, benchmark revisions, policies and results. Renaming this implementation
does not retroactively change those measurements.
